   },
   "text": "UNFINISHED BUSINESS - Pursuant to clause 1(c) of rule 19, the House resumed with further consideration of H.R. 3905. (consideration: CR H9535-9536)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-29",
   "actionTime": "16:39:33",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - Pursuant to clause 1(c) of rule 19, further consideration of H.R. 3905 is postponed.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-29",
   "actionTime": "16:38:45",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
