   "actionTime": "16:28:57",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 631, the House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Grijalva amendment No. 1.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-29",
   "actionTime": "16:16:23",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House resumed with debate on H.R. 3905.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-29",
   "actionTime": "15:22:51",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 3905.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-29",
   "actionTime": "15:21:09",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The rules provides 1 hour of general debate on both bills. For H.R. 3017, the bill is closed to amendments. For H.R. 3905, the rule provides for a specified amendment. The rule also provides for one motion to recommit with or without instructions on each bill.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-29",
   "actionTime": "15:21:04",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 631. (consideration: CR H9498-9512; text of amendment in the nature of a substitute: CR H9498-9499)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L220",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-29",
   "actionTime": "14:22:09",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule H. Res. 631 passed House.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-28",
   "actionTime": "18:53:38",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 631 Reported to House. The rules provides 1 hour of general debate on both bills. For H.R. 3017, the bill is closed to amendments. For H.R. 3905, the rule provides for a specified amendment. The rule also provides for one motion to recommit with or without instructions on each bill.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
